<title>UK: Elf says signs contract to buy Iraqi oil.</title>
<headline>Elf says signs contract to buy Iraqi oil.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French oil company Elf said on Monday it has signed a contract with Iraq's State Oil Marketing Organisation (SOMO) to lift Iraqi crude.</p>
<p>An Elf spokesman said the three month contract was signed on Friday.</p>
<p>He declined to give details on the volumes involved in the contract.</p>
</text>
